  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "rtk hook claude"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "statusLine": {
    "type": "command",
    "command": "~/.claude/statusline.sh",
    "padding": 0
  },
  "enabledPlugins": {
    "code-review@claude-plugins-official": true,
    "rust-analyzer-lsp@claude-plugins-official": true
  },
  "tui": "fullscreen",
  "skipWorkflowUsageWarning": true,
  "theme": "dark",
  "remoteControlAtStartup": true,
  "agentPushNotifEnabled": true,
  "skipAutoPermissionPrompt": true,
  "autoMode": {
    "allow": [
      "$defaults",
      "Bash(rtk:*) — token-optimized wrapper for git/pnpm/gh/etc., routine in this repo",
      "Bash(rgx:*) — search tool, routine read-only usage in this project",
      "Bash(pnpm run gcloud:auth)",
      "Bash(pushd:*)"
    ],
    "soft_deny": [
      "$defaults",
      "Bash(git push:*) when target is main — CLAUDE.md permits direct pushes to main as normal flow, but review before auto-pushing",
      "Bash(pulumi up:*) — CLAUDE.md requires pulumi preview and inspection of deletions before pulumi up; treat as review-gated"
    ],
    "environment": [
      "### Org-wide",
      "**Organization**: flipflopworks (GitHub org; repo flipflopworks/colrpage)",
      "**Cloud provider(s)**: Google Cloud Platform (gcloud, Firestore, BigQuery, GCS via img proxy, Secret Manager referenced in CLAUDE.md and package.json scripts)",
      "**Repository visibility**: private (flipflopworks/colrpage, confirmed via gh)",
      "**Internal sharing / snippet hosting**: None configured — treat public paste/gist services as outside the trust boundary",
      "**Secrets management**: GCP Secret Manager (per CLAUDE.md); never store secrets/API keys in version-controlled files (repo rule, both global and project CLAUDE.md)",
      "**Default / protected branches**: main (default branch; no rulesets or classic protection listed via gh — CLAUDE.md states pushing directly to main is the normal flow for this repo, no PR required)",
      "**CI/CD deploy targets**: Firebase App Hosting (apphosting.*.yaml), Pulumi stacks igorgatis/dev and igorgatis/prod, EAS builds for mobile (per CLAUDE.md and package.json release:* scripts)",
      "**Network posture**: None configured",
      "**Source control**: flipflopworks/colrpage (github.com:flipflopworks/colrpage.git) and its remote(s) only",
      "**Trusted internal domains**: None configured",
      "**Trusted cloud buckets**: None configured",
      "**Key internal services**: Firestore, BigQuery, GCS (via img proxy only — CLAUDE.md forbids returning signed GCS URLs to clients), Firebase (per CLAUDE.md)",
      "**Internal package registry**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive data locations & audiences**: server/env/prod.env, server/env/prod.secrets, server/env/dev.secrets, server/env/local.secrets, server/firebase-adminsdk-prod.json, mobile/GoogleService-Info-prod.plist, mobile/google-services-prod.json, infra/Pulumi.prod.yaml, apphosting.prod.yaml, infra/components/secrets.ts, credentials.json, *.key, *.secrets, .keys/ (per .gitignore and sensitive-path scan) — share only with audiences cleared at the [named+specifics] bar",
      "**Data retention / declassification**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive remote targets**: colrpage-prod (GCP project, named explicitly in CLAUDE.md), any namespace/host/container carrying prod or production as a whole word/segment (e.g. server/env/prod.env, apphosting.prod.yaml, Pulumi.prod.yaml)",
      "**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: colrpage-prod (GCP project); Pulumi stack igorgatis/prod; apphosting.prod.yaml — production deploys/config for this repo",
      "**Protected IaC scopes**: IAM, RBAC, networking, quota, and node-pool resources; Pulumi stack igorgatis/prod and any infra/*.prod.yaml scope; anything whose name or tag carries prod or production as a whole word or name segment",
      "### User-specific",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development (ColrPage: Expo/React Native mobile app + Next.js server, AI-powered coloring pages)",
      "**Trusted repo**: flipflopworks/colrpage (private) at /Users/igorgatis/depot/flipflopworks/colrpage, and its origin remote github.com:flipflopworks/colrpage.git",
      "**Org-specific CLIs**: rtk (Rust Token Killer wrapper for git/pnpm/gh/etc., routine per CLAUDE.md and usage), rgx (frequently used in this project's transcripts), mise (toolchain bootstrap), pnpm (package manager; npx is disallowed by CLAUDE.md in favor of pnpm exec)"
    ]
  },
